<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #111; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <h1 style="color: #1370c6; margin: 0;">Omnicassion</h1>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Update on Your Claim</h2>

    <p>Hello,</p>

    <p>We've reviewed your claim for <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> and unfortunately, we were unable to approve it at this time.</p>

    {{#if rejectionReason}}
    <div style="background: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #991b1b;">
        <strong>Reason:</strong><br>
        {{rejectionReason}}
      </p>
    </div>
    {{/if}}

    <h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px;">What can you do?</h3>

    <ul style="color: #666; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li>Review the reason above and address any issues mentioned</li>
      <li>Gather additional documentation if needed</li>
      <li>Submit a new claim request with updated information</li>
      <li>Contact our support team if you believe this was an error</li>
    </ul>

    <div style="background: #f4f4f5; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
        <strong>Common reasons for rejection:</strong>
      </p>
      <ul style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
        <li>Insufficient proof of business ownership</li>
        <li>Documents provided were unclear or unreadable</li>
        <li>Business information doesn't match the profile</li>
        <li>Unable to verify the business registration</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    {{#if supportUrl}}
    <p style="text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{supportUrl}}" style="background: #1370c6; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block;">Contact Support</a>
    </p>
    {{/if}}

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7; margin: 24px 0;" />

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
      We appreciate your interest in joining Omnicassion and hope to see you try again soon.
    </p>

    <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} Omnicassion. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
